                        "tool_use_id": "call_zhUyR1ztTsPGdnfQZXcCaGTI",
                        "type": "tool_result",
                        "content": "     1\u2192from keras.src import constraints\n     2\u2192from keras.src import initializers\n     3\u2192from keras.src import ops\n     4\u2192from keras.src import regularizers\n     5\u2192from keras.src.api_export import keras_export\n     6\u2192from keras.src.layers.activations.softmax import Softmax\n     7\u2192from keras.src.layers.core.einsum_dense import EinsumDense\n     8\u2192from keras.src.layers.layer import Layer\n     9\u2192from keras.src.layers.regularization.dropout import Dropout\n    10\u2192\n    11\u2192\n    12\u2192@keras_export(\"keras.layers.GroupQueryAttention\")\n    13\u2192class GroupedQueryAttention(Layer):\n    14\u2192    \"\"\"Grouped Query Attention layer.\n    15\u2192\n    16\u2192    This is an implementation of grouped-query attention introduced by\n    17\u2192    [Ainslie et al., 2023](https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.13245). Here\n    18\u2192    `num_key_value_heads` denotes number of groups, setting\n    19\u2192    `num_key_value_heads` to 1 is equivalent to multi-query attention, and\n    20\u2192    when `num_key_value_heads` is equal to `num_query_heads` it is equivalent\n    21\u2192    to multi-head attention.\n    22\u2192\n    23\u2192    This layer first projects `query`, `key`, and `value` tensors. Then, `key`\n    24\u2192    and `value` are repeated to match the number of heads of `query`.\n    25\u2192\n    26\u2192    Then, the `query` is scaled and dot-producted with `key` tensors. These are\n    27\u2192    softmaxed to obtain attention probabilities. The value tensors are then\n    28\u2192    interpolated by these probabilities and concatenated back to a single\n    29\u2192    tensor.\n    30\u2192\n    31\u2192    Args:\n    32\u2192        head_dim: Size of each attention head.\n    33\u2192        num_query_heads: Number of query attention heads.\n    34\u2192        num_key_value_heads: Number of key and value attention heads.\n    35\u2192        dropout: Dropout p